    {
      "key": "media_with_content_JLVGCA",
      "type": "media-with-content",
      "texts": [
        "Origin & Philosophy",
        "Nimbus",
        "Every collection at Maple begins with a question. For Nimbus, that question was a simple one: what would furniture feel like if comfort were the starting point rather than something added on at the end? The answer arrived the way the best ideas tend to, quietly and completely, and it looked like the inside of a cloud.Nimbus was shaped by watching how people actually inhabit their spaces. The searching for a room that breathes. The relief of a chair that does not demand a particular posture. The slow pleasure of a sofa that improves with use rather than declining from the day it arrives. These are not decorating ambitions. They are the way a well-considered home actually feels, and that feeling is what every piece in the Nimbus range was designed to create."
      ],
      "images": [
        "https://shop.maplefurnishers.com/cdn/shop/files/Untitled_design_35.png?height=1024&v=1779725875"
      ],
      "videos": [],
      "handles": [],
